  "body": "Presenting All Offers! Don't miss out! \r\nElevated, stylish and superbly positioned! Browns Bay Best! \r\n\r\nWhether it's a morning coffee in the village, a leisurely stroll along the beach or unwinding at home while the sky puts on a show at sunset, this is a lifestyle you'll love coming home to. \r\nDesigned by Matz Architects, this boutique apartment offers contemporary living with a focus on quality, comfort and effortless enjoyment. Light-filled open-plan living provides a welcoming space to relax or entertain, complemented by a well-appointed designer kitchen and modern finishes throughout..\r\n\r\nTwo generous bedrooms, including a master with its own ensuite, are complemented by a second bathroom, offering flexibility for couples, professionals, small families or those wanting a little extra space. Add secure garage parking, lift access and a low-maintenance lifestyle, and you'll find plenty to love here.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Browns Bay really does deliver! With the beach, cafes, restaurants, local shops and everyday essentials all within easy reach, you can enjoy the best of village and coastal living without needing to venture far.\r\n\r\n* Elevated outlook - enjoy gorgeous sunset views and a beautiful backdrop to your evenings\r\n* Two generous bedrooms - including a master bedroom with its own ensuite\r\n* Two bathrooms - added convenience with underfloor heating\r\n* Contemporary open-plan living - an inviting space to relax, dine and entertain\r\n* Designer kitchen - quality finishes and a stylish, practical layout\r\n* Architectural design - created by acclaimed Matz Architects\r\n* Secure parking - your own car park included within the garage\r\n* Easy access - built-in lift for added convenience\r\n* Comfort all year round - engineered oak flooring and high-efficiency heat pumps\r\n* Pet-friendly living - subject to the applicable body corporate rules\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n* Browns Bay Beach - enjoy morning walks, a swim or a relaxed afternoon by the water\r\n* Village at your doorstep - cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday essentials close by\r\n* In-zone schooling - Browns Bay Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n* An active coastal lifestyle - enjoy nearby beaches, walking tracks and local sporting facilities\r\n* Connected living - convenient access to Albany, the wider North Shore and motorway connections\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing without compromising on lifestyle or looking for a lock-up-and-leave in a sought-after coastal location, this is an opportunity to make Browns Bay your own.\r\nEnjoy the freedom of low-maintenance living, the buzz of the village and those gorgeous sunsets at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nSay yes to the address!\r\nCan't make the scheduled viewings? No problem! We're happy to accommodate private viewings. Please contact Claire Cassin at Ray White Mairangi Bay to arrange - we look forward to showing you through!\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale (Unless Sold Prior) \r\n5:00pm Wednesday 25th November 2026 \r\n\r\nWe welcome agents from all other agencies from day one.\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34477\r\n407/32 Anzac Road, Browns Bay",
